{"summary":"The towering word-game that fits in your pocket!","description":"A towering word-game and mystery-story adventure!\n\nFollowing a sudden earthquake, Seb must escape a crumbling skyscraper. Along the way he will make some intriguing new friends, and together they might just unravel the sinister origins of the 'quake, assuming they can evade the mysterious stalker in close pursuit...\n\nStarting at the top and working down, the game's 90+ levels take place inside the skyscraper. The player creates words on a grid of letters and obstacles, clearing a path for Seb and friends to descend.\n\nGive your brain a workout with this charming word puzzle game.\n\nNote: Supports English (US and UK) words only.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NDTnDx85Imc?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sSiqSdfUxe1cpjfWmgnvqUSpQ4jWq0O5i8XMcrEfi1dyL1gEI3pnkPQf2d1VJaH6h7t7nlNEVP3bFeXdjAvXuw","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aNT1UXXQ51P9Gh6jh8UGda9nprmrzPNzziMztVFMeuybRKDBKtghJTiUhdLJyqnrqFEI5rbHEidsKvDmYa7Pylw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/s0A0j_dgSp1ygFJ9CnJY0GEJkbHGx3zEezGY8GnJuZg9Wfx_76M0L3NNzG78Efqjj99ng5PN7Au6_SJBoET8woc","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lOiQSxaUuP5UHX3eQNLRU8IwCTVMrDrz5i6xG98palu-_iwPSK26fxziDjm3t6UwuDBxiUgvP23VclSWyco3Ng","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-MmVJknJQLF_HQKDfVjQOzIxLOZ8IpWpEpHtdR4gjd93TqkZksWd63oIf--oBzsSWdvZbWLtWGtV2mdab8m2TQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0jukuEoCWaMCjvpbCs1cIwA1v9lJCsEtUPx3o-paH0_HWJDpxDdk7iLEnF_oK0mem9cswF9RqkNzxbQTHuX1BQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/B8BSb4WA3Erjdka32PJZsApSx9xRV_TlW-XfwR1nH5x6Jcg4jL5Af3widYL_SYp5OOCu6FBygZsa0CFduC8FNQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Rl9ul_XKJmz2lFk_sqW7boYVR7X9u6GgbYlVF2141__cIOJYIRrCAM9ECv1jk7rM4yeXEiRR1efDCC0vCWkJTw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/J-H1F-5ll-lS_ntnXdJSIZpscP67MUv-sWhxpj7hOHln_G378shXITOBtRL